+issueNumber: MDL-88319
+notes:
+  core:
+    - message: >-
+        A new hook `\core\hook\output\before_help_icon_rendered` is dispatched
+        before a help icon is rendered. Callbacks can modify the mutable
+        template context, add HTML before or after the icon using
+        `add_before_icon()` / `add_after_icon()`, or replace the icon output
+        entirely using `set_replacement()`.
+      type: improved
